{
 "id": 1896956,
 "titulo": "10/13 Update Details",
 "fecha": 1791874827544,
 "modificada": 1791874924029,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1896956",
 "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1791868152547\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/8898bbb98ed343da91b6987059df7f0c_1791868152547_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The power of ancient magic that shakes&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">time, space, and reality is coming to our Agents!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The theme for this October Update is Darkness and Magic.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Wiccan</span>, a wizard with unfathomable potential, and&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Morgan Le Fay</span>, an immortal witch wielding dark incantations,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">have received<span style=\"color:#9900ff;\"> </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">New Uniforms </span>and <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-4 Advancements</span>.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Furthermore, <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Agatha Harkness</span>, possessor of ancient knowledge and secret magic,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">has appeared in the world of MARVEL Future Fight&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">along with<span style=\"color:#9900ff;\"> </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-3 and Tier-4 Advancements</span>.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Also, Spider-Man and Ghost Rider can now break past their growth limits&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">and <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">expand their maximum level </span>to Lv.90.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">new boss</span> for Giant Boss Raid! The psionic entity of hatred, <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Onslaught</span>, has arrived,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">alongside a new Custom Gear, the <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">C.T.P. of Ascent</span>,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">which will support boosting our Agents' Instinct Attack.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Please check below for more details on these and various other improvements designed&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">to make your gameplay experience more convenient!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff9900;\"><strong>▣ One New Hero</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out the abilities of the powerful witch Agatha Harkness &lt;Modern&gt;,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">who delves into all sorts of mystical magical knowledge.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* The skill effects of the new hero are based on the maximum skill level stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1653\" id=\"1791868348839\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/9b9b1b169e23457ea57b6e7da9266e48_1791868348839_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff9900;\"><strong>▣ Two New Uniforms</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">To celebrate the Darkness and Magic theme update, 2 new Uniforms have been added.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out the abilities of Wiccan &lt;Young Avengers&gt; and Morgan Le Fay &lt;Classic&gt;.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* The skill effects of the new Uniforms are based on the maximum skill level stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* The two new Uniforms </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">will be on sale for 40% off during the &lt;October Update Celebration Event&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"> and can be checked and purchased in the Marvel Universe and Uniform Room after the Event.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1688\" id=\"1791868362443\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/03c763ce8d724b04a855a7c99c0373ef_1791868362443_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1621\" id=\"1791868367400\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/9ae09039edc944fdaa500eb6859dd55a_1791868367400_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">​<span style=\"color:#ff9900;\"><strong>▣ Agatha Harkness Tier-3 &amp; Tier-4</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A Tier-4 Striker Skill and a Tier-3 Ultimate Skill have been added for Agatha Harkness.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">She will realize her desires using the ancient knowledge and magical abilities accumulated over centuries.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* The Tier-4 Striker Skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"655\" id=\"1791868398315\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/da4f4e04e76e464f843d5b2787b74883_1791868398315_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1791868446801\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/63908ff2cd3b49d38c8f75dc5dded31c_1791868446801.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff9900;\"><strong>▣ Wiccan and Morgan Le Fay Tier-4</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>① Wiccan</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A Tier-4 Striker Skill has been added for Wiccan,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">the next-generation Demiurge with infinite potential to rewrite the laws of magic.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* The Tier-4 Striker Skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"294\" id=\"1791868464625\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/e66e41ef7d204dac945bc7880d775a30_1791868464625_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>② Morgan Le Fay</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A Tier-4 Striker Skill has been added for Morgan Le Fay.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">She will plunge all who stand in her way into despair using immortal magic and dark authority.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* The Tier-4 Striker Skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"349\" id=\"1791868478680\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/507093da26f449adbaa3e47d3659d990_1791868478680_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff9900;\"><strong>▣ Spider-Man and Ghost Rider Max Level Expansion</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Agents, a max level expansion update is here!&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">You can now unlock even greater potential for your heroes.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Experience the thrill of surpassing limits and reaching new heights.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"350\" id=\"1791868615325\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/98053a14332b4a658b39c5c126619cd3_1791868615325_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* The max level expansion for each hero will proceed sequentially through updates.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Here is a guide to the new growth conditions applied alongside the maximum level expansion.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>① 3rd Potential Search and Realization</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Potential Points can be acquired by clearing World Boss Legend+ or higher difficulties.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Heroes who have completed Tier-4 Advancement can proceed with the 3rd Potential Search.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- For 3rd Potential Points, unlike previous potentials, a single clear will not charge it to 100%.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">Points are acquired based on the hero's Native Tier grade.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1791868672721\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/9ed7ed68eb94458994e0412f9e10e928_1791868672721_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>② Potential Enhancement</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">After the 3rd Potential Realization, you can proceed with Potential Enhancement.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Just like the 1st and 2nd Potential Enhancements, specific materials are required,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">and the enhancement success rate increases as more materials are used.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Potential Enhancement Levels: 80, 82, 84, 86, 88, 90</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1791868690616\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/ab858ff33352416cb74f65382c783064_1791868690616_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1791868704127\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/5caf41f54b3a496f976956e16b2019d1_1791868704127_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>③ Level Up (Lv.80 - Lv.90)</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">You can level up using a new material, the 'Cosmic Seed'.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This item can be acquired from Giant Boss Raid 'Galactus or higher difficulty'.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- The maximum amount of ‘Cosmic Seeds’ that can be acquired per day is 300.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- For Native Tier heroes, the amount of materials required for leveling up will be higher.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1791868731580\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/9db110e2ea4548009a125a7f57770cba_1791868731580_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff9900;\"><strong>▣ New Giant Boss Raid Onslaught</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">An entity with powerful psychic abilities and mental strength, Onslaught arrives.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Born from the fusion of the dark inner selves of Professor X and Magneto,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Onslaught seeks to drive everything into ruin using his immense power.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. A new boss, Onslaught, has been added to the Giant Boss Raid content.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Soul of the Faltine and Book of the Vishanti can be acquired from this stage.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Entry Conditions: Must possess at least 3 heroes that have reached Tier-4, 6★ Rank, 6★ Mastery, and Lv.80.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1791868746519\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/4f9f47d6c1d543df87e5b1333e9236d5_1791868746519_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* Regardless of difficulty, once a hero has participated, that hero&nbsp;cannot be used again in any difficulty until the reset.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* For Onslaught, 40 Boost Points are consumed per 1 additional reward count. (Same as Dormammu).</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* The Owned Character Bonus is assigned to Tier-4 heroes based on a set probability, and the list changes upon clearing the stage.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. The Buff Application Method will be applied differently from existing Giant Boss Raids / other contents.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ Giant Boss Raid (Onslaught) → All buffs are applied to the self only.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">As shown in the example below, the target of Cyclops's Leader skill target changes from \"All Allies\" to \"Self\" and the buff will not apply to team members like Gorr / Nick Fury.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"263\" id=\"1791868765988\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/75ed9b07eebf4c758bd6785e95163a5c_1791868765988_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ Targets for Buff Application Method Change</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Skills (Leader, Passive, Tier-2 Passive)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Uniform Effects</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Custom Gear</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Artifacts</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* For buffs caused by 'Active Skills', the application target remains unchanged.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Ex) Nick Fury &lt;Secret Avengers&gt;&nbsp; - Active Skill 5 (Flare Gun)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Applies to: All Allies</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">• 100% chance to grant <u>All Damage Immunity</u> (1 sec.)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ Maintained Buff Application Methods</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Account-applied effects (Comic Cards, Emblems, Team-Up Collections, X of Swords, Agent Bonus, etc.)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Team Bonuses (Activated, Team Bonus Per Character, All)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- J.A.R.V.I.S. Effects</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff9900;\"><strong>▣ New C.T.P. &amp; Reforging</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A new Custom Gear, the C.T.P. of Ascent, has been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Utilize its ability to maximize Instinct Attack and its effect of ignoring damage decrease rates.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* The options are based on the maximum stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* One of the two reforge options will be selected based on a set probability.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* After the October update, the C.T.P. of Ascent can be acquired through Store - Dimension Chest - Custom Gear Chest and the New C.T.P. Release Celebration! Secret Shop Event.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"835\" id=\"1791868839680\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b9dcc67978af4d6b8ac04d06ddd83a52_1791868839680_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff9900;\"><strong>▣ New Artifact and Improvements</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. After the October update, Exclusive Passive Skill Artifacts for Agatha Harkness will be added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">﻿* The skill effects are based on Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"331\" id=\"1791868857093\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/c5a5ca27a91447fbb1dead38424bcaed_1791868857093_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Exclusive Passive Skill Artifacts for Morgan Le Fay will be improved.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">﻿* The skill effects are based on Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"447\" id=\"1791868873236\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b538a882cbc642a2a64969280824b82b_1791868873236_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff9900;\"><strong>▣ New Future Pass Plus Season &amp; Special Icons</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A new season of Future Pass Plus will begin after the update.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#9900ff;\"><strong>[Future Pass Plus Rewards]</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"776\" id=\"1791868893572\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/181eb9da73114ca2bd5b1f86d672bd3e_1791868893572_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- The Future Pass Plus effects will apply immediately upon purchase and cannot be refunded.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Future Pass Plus - Legendary / Mythic that has been unlocked will only be applied during the season the Pass was purchased.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">The Pass rewards will only be available during the same season.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- The Future Pass Plus - Mythic can be purchased after purchasing the Future Pass Plus - Legendary.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Future Pass Plus - Legendary / Mythic will not be available for purchase when the season is about to end.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>​​</strong>New Special Icons for Agents have been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Collect two new Icons as Future Pass Plus rewards,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">one as an Otherworld Battle reward, and one more from the upcoming Event!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#9900ff;\"><strong>[October Update New Special Icon]</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1791868927378\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/e97a8e3a14684a33b8640d8900573a1f_1791868927378.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1791868931529\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/2e1fb9e675c64f9e88c32f09367d31a8_1791868931529.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1791868936934\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/34435742549d4109b096b863ac69b955_1791868936934.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1791868941631\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/49333e733cc94f8aac0c841c797066c2_1791868941631.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff9900;\"><strong>▣ Update Hot Deals</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\">1. Update Hot Deal products have been added.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\">- Event Schedule:&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\">After the 10/13 Maintenance - 11/10 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0),</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\">After the 10/13 Maintenance - 11/10 (Tue) 6:59 (PST)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\">- Find various update celebration products like Hot Deal! 100M Gold Pack, and Hot Deal! Custom Gear Unequip Pack in the Hot Deals category in the Store.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\">Please check the details in-game after the update.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"104\" id=\"1791868955195\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d6339eb5afc54e7bb52660bd4693c8e8_1791868955195_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\">2. Hot Deal products to support reaching level 90 have been added as follows.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\">- Event Schedule:&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\">After the 10/13 Maintenance - 11/10 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0),</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\">After the 10/13 Maintenance - 11/10 (Tue) 6:59 (PST)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"607\" id=\"1791868976341\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/83bb02f7834c40f5afc8c63db9dbb33c_1791868976341_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\">3. J.A.R.V.I.S. Chip products that assist heroes' battles have been added as follows.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\">- Event Schedule:&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\">After the 10/13 Maintenance - 11/10 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0),</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\">After the 10/13 Maintenance - 11/10 (Tue) 6:59 (PST)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"792\" id=\"1791868995031\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a69d170dfbfb439584d0eba561ee3486_1791868995031_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff9900;\"><strong>▣ Other Improvements and Changes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. J.A.R.V.I.S.: Added a name change function to each preset.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- You can change the name via the J.A.R.V.I.S. menu and change pop-up.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1791869013541\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/9b9cc1240c9744889f9e32588bf8b058_1791869013541_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1791869023071\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/e4d3cb0007b94c9082e05507569212fc_1791869023071_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Improved the crafting of Tier-2 growth materials to allow the use of Tier-3 / Awakening materials.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Target Items for Crafting: Rank 1 Black Anti-matter, Phoenix Feather, M'kraan Crystal, Norn Stone of Chaos</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Newly Added Materials: Essence of Dimension, Titan Component Pack, Cosmic Cube Fragment, Awakening Crystal, Mandalay Gem Fragment</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1791869041292\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/880519bbff4d4a78bbdd281ac5705e6f_1791869041292_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1791869049274\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/80d5d637d9614309928ad6d00edc168f_1791869049274_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. Uniform Collection: Improved the system so that when a completed collection or an unregistered uniform exists, entering the Uniform Collection menu will automatically navigate to the collection of that theme.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The completion display for the Uniform Collection has been changed from percentages (%) to numbers (Owned / Total).</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Ex) 75% → 3/4</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. Certain skill texts have been adjusted.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Before: Excluding bosses, ignores enemy's damage decrease by N%.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- After: Excluding bosses, ignores enemy's basic damage decrease by N%.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Before: Ignores boss damage decrease by N%.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- After: Ignores boss basic damage decrease by N%.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Before: Ignores enemy’s damage decrease by N%, ignores additional amount by N% of concentration</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- After: Ignores enemy’s basic damage decrease by N%, ignores additional amount by N% of concentration</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff9900;\"><strong>▣ Game Error Fixes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. Fixed an issue to prevent Crystal Enhance from proceeding under specific situations during Relay Enhance.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Shadowland: Fixed an issue where the Combat icon was displayed on each hero's portrait on the team setup screen in Training Mode and Normal / Challenge Mode.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. Shadowland: Fixed language display errors.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Fixed an issue where the 'Start' button would not display in the set language when above floor 36 in Shadowland (Normal / Training Mode).</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Fixed an issue where entering floor 36 or above in Normal Mode under specific situations would display as 'Start Training'.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. Fixed an issue where some buff icons would not disappear when using Falcon &lt;What If... Zombies?!&gt; Ultimate Skill.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">5. World Boss: Fixed an issue where if Today's World Boss was changed and the game was not reconnected until the next day, the Today's World Boss information would not refresh on the World Boss lobby screen (limited to Mythic category) and would display the previous day's boss.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">6. Fixed an issue where chat notifications were not generated upon acquiring a J.A.R.V.I.S. EX Chip.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\">We will return with various content improvements, so please stay tuned.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\">Thank you.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1791868147305\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/7d7140483bcb4834a4f3f3915a019ef3_1791868147305_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n"
}